CLANG_MODULE_CACHE_PATH=/tmp/afu-scale-clang-cache SWIFTPM_MODULECACHE_OVERRIDE=/tmp/afu-scale-swiftpm-cache swift test --disable-sandbox --scratch-path /tmp/afu-scale-live-session-build
swift build -c release --disable-sandbox --scratch-path /tmp/afu-scale-live-session-release
bash scripts/check-public-repo.sh
git diff --check
git status --short
```

完成标准：以上命令全部成功；默认入口选择 `.live`，历史入口仅由 `--sync-history` 选择；代码与日志不新增体重、抗阻、生日、设备标识或原始 BLE 帧输出；LaunchAgent 和后台读取器在开发验证期间保持停止。
